      "title": "Nucor Projects Higher Q3 Earnings on Improved Steel Pricing",
      "summary": "Nucor Corporation (NUE) announced Q3 2026 earnings guidance of $5.55-$5.65 per diluted share, up from $5.04 in Q2, driven by higher selling prices in its Steel Mills segment and increased volumes and pricing in Steel Products. The company continues share buybacks, having repurchased 2.03 million shares in Q3 at an average price of $247.04. Raw Materials segment performance is expected to weaken due to lower pricing and shipments.",
